STALE means the adaptor is up and the value has not moved; it does not say why. Compare the
age against the uptime above: an age in the thousands of seconds with an uptime only a few
thousand seconds means the value came from an earlier boot, i.e. this sensorfw daemon has
never received a sample from this sensor. Do NOT restart sensorfwd to 'fix' it -- on this
device a sensorfwd restart is what kills the container's sensors HAL (docs 71).

